fornthulani
===========

A from-scratch micro HTTP framework in Rust.
Responds with JSON, MessagePack, or streamed file downloads.
Controllers are plain fns. Routes support :params. Statuses are typed constants.
Zero HTTP dependencies — built on std::net::TcpListener.

Named after the Old Norse *forn* (ancient) + *þulani* (reciter/list).
fornthulani recites responses from an ordered route table.


